    {
      "id": "jbT_gG8EwxCDG5dEPg4G1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11402.54959338538,
      "y": 6536.0358575744185,
      "width": 1805.3704952345252,
      "height": 317.20658927128216,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b17",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 714846041,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 838175033,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793852680340,
      "created": 1793852478676,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sequence_no 解决\"从哪开始拉\"的问题，\nsource_version 解决\"要不要更新\"的问题。两者\n配合，实现了精确增量同步 + 幂等写入！",
      "fontSize": 84.5884238056752,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sequence_no 解决\"从哪开始拉\"的问题，source_version 解决\"要不要更新\"的问题。两者配合，实现了精确增量同步 + 幂等写入！",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EtDaq2bL-yq7wNCiAYIqR",
      "type": "stickynote",
      "x": -11440,
      "y": 6900,
      "width": 1506.6665649414074,
      "height": 954.6667480468795,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffdf6b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 2
      },
      "seed": 736199001,
      "version": 1001,
      "versionNonce": 15431961,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vnOW4FRzLuEG8bmFP_Mnf"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1793868777642,
      "created": 1793852686348,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "baseHeight": 954.6667480468795
    },
    {
      "id": "vnOW4FRzLuEG8bmFP_Mnf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11424,
      "y": 7017.333374023439,
      "width": 1178.747802734375,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1LV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1902242169,
      "version": 588,
      "versionNonce": 925822457,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793868777642,
      "created": 1793852695734,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果只有sequence_no ,没有source_version会发生什么？\n\n1. 同步客户端拉取 sequence_no=3 的事件（更新 A，version=2）\n2. 写入本地：A.source_version = 2\n3. 同步客户端拉取 sequence_no=6 的事件（再次更新 A，version=3）\n4. 写入本地：A.source_version = 3\n\n看起来没问题？但如果：\n- 网络抖动导致 sequence_no=6 的事件先到达\n- sequence_no=3 的事件后到达\n\n结果：\n- 先处理 seq=6：本地 A.version = 3\n- 后处理 seq=3：本地 A.version = 2（旧版本覆盖了新版本！）\n\n没有 source_version 的版本护栏，就会出现\"旧数据覆盖新数据\"的问题！",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "EtDaq2bL-yq7wNCiAYIqR",
      "originalText": "如果只有sequence_no ,没有source_version会发生什么？\n\n1. 同步客户端拉取 sequence_no=3 的事件（更新 A，version=2）\n2. 写入本地：A.source_version = 2\n3. 同步客户端拉取 sequence_no=6 的事件（再次更新 A，version=3）\n4. 写入本地：A.source_version = 3\n\n看起来没问题？但如果：\n- 网络抖动导致 sequence_no=6 的事件先到达\n- sequence_no=3 的事件后到达\n\n结果：\n- 先处理 seq=6：本地 A.version = 3\n- 后处理 seq=3：本地 A.version = 2（旧版本覆盖了新版本！）\n\n没有 source_version 的版本护栏，就会出现\"旧数据覆盖新数据\"的问题！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
